 font-size: 14px;\">2019년 1기로 시작된 컴투스 플레이어는 게임/IT업계에서 성장하길 원하는 대학생들에게 다양한 직무 간접 경험을 전하고 있습니다.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">[모집정보]</span><br style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">- 모집분야 : PD(영상 편집 및 촬영), 디자인</span><br style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Pretendard_KR, Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dot